      "description": "Clean up legacy backup notifications after upgrade\n\nKeep the collision-free Signal IDs for new backup alerts, and remove old Molly alerts only when the active notification matches the backup channel. This avoids deleting old conversation notifications that shared the previous numeric range.\n\nAI-Generated: true\n\nBased-On-Source-Commit: e6194d5b335b7066c80297ba0b334bd975e55e56\n\nAI-assisted compatibility changes: restore imports across source checkpoints.\n\nAI-assisted compatibility changes: use a seven-day duration in the existing backup exporter test.\n\nAI-assisted compatibility changes: restore Molly logger collection.",
      "ai_generated": true,
      "before_tree": "19aafb043c2603862da8ae37fe2759016ac8d287",
      "after_tree": "cd881fc86c37dee767ccaad04862e3271444b657",
