    {
      "id": "followups/passphrase-timeout-fallback",
      "source_commit": "53bb4511abbfd5339db82305f1da8cb1f0655516",
      "description": "Keep the passphrase timeout when foreground promotion is refused\n\nAI-assisted compatibility changes. The port caught Android's refusal to\npromote KeyCachingService to the foreground and continued, where Molly let\nthe exception propagate. If the service was then destroyed while the process\nsurvived, a later screen-off could miss scheduling the passphrase timeout.\nSchedule the configured timeout when promotion is refused and keep it until\npromotion succeeds with the screen on and unlocked.\n\nAI-Generated: true\n\nBased-On-Source-Commit: 27347983e6669e4c7689213e1c9447e43694f0d2",
      "ai_generated": true,
      "before_tree": "cd881fc86c37dee767ccaad04862e3271444b657",
      "after_tree": "db57911a1d1a93efbed65eab782de764ce6ec272",
      "paths": 2,
