      "description": "Restore Molly's badges, locked debug log details and dynamic colors\n\nAI-assisted compatibility changes. The port lost three Molly 8.19.2-4\nbehaviors that a later fix on another branch restored but that never\nreached this release: contact settings show the recipient's badges again,\nwith their names for accessibility; the debug log's system information no\nlonger reads the locked SignalStore for the first installed version; and\ndynamic-color themes use Molly's light extended-color base again.\n\nAI-Generated: true\n\nBased-On-Source-Commit: 538be6ced48eae839052e17e30a24bae380c54f9",
